      "post_id": "2097043668062367960",
      "url": "https://x.com/kenkenlewu/status/2097043668062367960",
      "text": "The first thing to do is check your Temu app.\n\n1. Check your tracking details: Go to your order and open the tracking information. It shows exactly where your parcel has reached and the local courier service handling it.\n\n2. Contact the courier service: The courier’s name, contact details and phone number are always provided in the tracking information. Reach out to them, explain what happened, and give them the phone number of the delivery man who blocked you.\n\n3. Visit their office if necessary: You can locate the courier’s delivery office in your city and go there with your tracking/order number. They can trace the parcel and help you sort out the delivery.\n\n4. Contact Temu: If the courier service doesn’t resolve it, report the issue directly to Temu through the app. Give them the tracking details and the delivery man’s number, and explain exactly what happened.\n\nI’ve never experienced this before sha, but I think these steps should work.",
      "original_text": "The first thing to do is check your Temu app.\n\n1. Check your tracking details: Go to your order and open the tracking information. It shows exactly where your parcel has reached and the local courier service handling it.\n\n2. Contact the courier service: The courier’s name, contact details and phone number are always provided in the tracking information. Reach out to them, explain what happened, and give them the phone number of the delivery man who blocked you.\n\n3. Visit their office if necessary: You can locate the courier’s delivery office in your city and go there with your tracking/order number. They can trace the parcel and help you sort out the delivery.\n\n4. Contact Temu: If the courier service doesn’t resolve it, report the issue directly to Temu through the app. Give them the tracking details and the delivery man’s number, and explain exactly what happened.\n\nI’ve never experienced this before sha, but I think these steps should work.",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "首先要做的是检查你的 Temu app。\n\n1. 查看你的物流详情：进入你的订单并打开物流信息。它会准确显示你的包裹已经到达哪里，以及负责处理的本地快递服务。\n\n2. 联系快递服务：物流信息里总是会提供快递公司的名称、联系方式和电话号码。联系他们，说明发生了什么，并把那个拉黑你的送货员的电话号码给他们。\n\n3. 如有必要，去他们的办公室：你可以找到你所在城市的快递配送办公室，带上你的物流/订单编号过去。他们可以追踪包裹，并帮你解决配送问题。\n\n4. 联系 Temu：如果快递服务没有解决问题，就直接通过 app 向 Temu 报告这个问题。把物流详情和送货员的号码给他们，并准确说明发生了什么。\n\n我以前倒是从没遇到过这种事，但我觉得这些步骤应该会有效。",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "summary_zh": "用户讨论物流、配送或包裹追踪体验。",
